 SG_ TMSErrorCode : 32|8@1+ (1,0) [0|0] ""  JETSON,DATALOGGER
 SG_ CurrentState : 24|8@1+ (1,0) [0|0] ""  JETSON,DATALOGGER
 SG_ ECUErrorCode : 8|16@1+ (1,0) [0|0] ""  JETSON,DATALOGGER
 SG_ InverterErrorCode : 0|8@1+ (1,0) [0|0] ""  JETSON,DATALOGGER

