 SG_ LimitSwitchLeft : 32|1@1+ (1,0) [0|0] ""  JETSON
 SG_ LimitSwitchRight : 33|1@1+ (1,0) [0|0] ""  JETSON

BO_ 1186 IMUAcceleration: 6 DATALOGGER
